<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Leave Management & Workflow</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Simplify the complexity of time-off management through automated accruals, transparent 
            team calendars, and an online approval engine built for the Zimbabwean regulatory framework.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated Accrual & Balance Integrity</h2>
        <p>
            Eliminate the errors of manual leave tracking. The Pindah Leave module automatically 
            calculates accruals and maintains individual balances for all leave types—Annual, 
            Sick, Maternity, Paternity, and Compassionate—in accordance with the Labour Act 
            and specific NEC codes. Employee self-service allows staff to view their live 
            balances and application history anytime, significantly reducing the administrative 
            load on HR teams for simple balance checks.
        </p>
        <p>
            Integrated public holiday management for Gazetted Zimbabwean holidays and 
            company-specific shutdowns ensures that leave is deducted with absolute 
            precision.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Frictionless Approval & Visibility</h2>
        <p>
            Manage time-off requests through a structured multi-level approval pipeline. Staff 
            submit applications via the web or mobile app, which then routes through 
            supervisors according to established organizational hierarchies. Team Leave 
            Calendars provide managers with visibility of overlapping requests, 
            ensuring that departmental operational capacity is always protected before 
            leave is approved.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated email and in-app notifications keep all stakeholders updated on the status 
            of their requests, while successful approvals are instantly synchronized 
            with the payroll module for accurate salary processing.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Liability Valuation & Reporting</h2>
        <p>
            Gain visibility into your financial exposure. The system provides real-time reporting 
            on the organization's total 'Leave Liability' value, calculated by multiplying 
            individual leave balances by their current salary rates. This authoritative 
            data is essential for financial statement accruals and end-of-year 
            audits, providing finance teams with the absolute accuracy required for 
            modern corporate governance.
        </p>
        <p>
            Deep-dive analytics identify trends in sick leave or absenteeism by department, 
            enabling HR professionals to identify potential wellness or management issues 
            proactively.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

